blobface is a port of blobatar (https://github.com/Alain00/blobatar) by Alain
(@alain_0012), licensed under MIT.

blobface is an unofficial port. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
original author. It reproduces blobatar's generation algorithm, numeric
constants and output format (ported from blobatar v2.7.0, commit
ebb7ea4808b1263629fc8fa65e2398b9cbdb6f6b) so that the same input produces the
same face. blobatar's logo, wordmark, website copy and visual branding are not
included.

